export async function saveSupplierSettlement(type,record){type=supplierType(type);const data=await readSupplierSettlements(),date=supplierDate(record?.date),day=new Date(`${date}T12:00:00`).getDay();if(!date||!clean(record?.description))throw new Error('Informe data e descrição.');if(type==='luizinho'&&(day<1||day>5))throw new Error('As notas do Luizinho devem ser lançadas de segunda a sexta.');data[type].push({...record,id:record?.id||crypto.randomUUID(),date,createdAt:new Date().toISOString(),updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()});return writeSupplierSettlements(data)}
export async function updateSupplierSettlement(type,id,changes){type=supplierType(type);const data=await readSupplierSettlements(),index=data[type].findIndex(item=>item.id===id);if(index<0)throw new Error('Lançamento do fornecedor não encontrado.');const date=supplierDate(changes?.date||data[type][index].date),day=new Date(`${date}T12:00:00`).getDay();if(type==='luizinho'&&(day<1||day>5))throw new Error('As notas do Luizinho devem ser lançadas de segunda a sexta.');data[type][index]={...data[type][index],...changes,id,date,updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()};return writeSupplierSettlements(data)}
export async function deleteSupplierSettlement(type,id){type=supplierType(type);const data=await readSupplierSettlements();data[type]=data[type].filter(item=>item.id!==id);return writeSupplierSettlements(data)}

async function applyLuizinhoStockDelta(session,previousItems,nextItems){const[current,metadataRow]=await Promise.all([request('/rest/v1/estoque?select=*',{token:session.access_token}),stockMetadataConfig(session)]),byKey=new Map(current.map(row=>[stockKey(row),row])),metadata={...stockMetadataItems(metadataRow)},deltas=new Map(),normalizedNext=normalizeLuizinhoItems(nextItems),nextKeys=new Set(normalizedNext.map(item=>stockKey({code:item.code,description:item.description,application:item.brand})));for(const item of normalizeLuizinhoItems(previousItems)){const key=stockKey({code:item.code,description:item.description,application:item.brand}),entry=deltas.get(key)||{item,quantity:0};entry.quantity-=item.quantity;deltas.set(key,entry)}for(const item of normalizedNext){const key=stockKey({code:item.code,description:item.description,application:item.brand}),entry=deltas.get(key)||{item,quantity:0};entry.item=item;entry.quantity+=item.quantity;deltas.set(key,entry)}for(const[key,entry]of deltas){if(!entry.quantity&&!nextKeys.has(key))continue;const found=byKey.get(key),previous=found?metadata[found.id]||{}:{},quantity=Math.max(0,Number(found?.quantidade||0)+entry.quantity),cost=Number(entry.item.unitValue)||0,markup=Number(previous.markup)||0,saleValue=found&&previous.cost!==undefined?cost*(1+markup/100):Number(found?.valor_unitario||cost),body={codigo:entry.item.code||found?.codigo||null,descricao:entry.item.description||found?.descricao,aplicacao:entry.item.brand||found?.aplicacao||null,quantidade:quantity,valor_unitario:Number(saleValue.toFixed(2)),foto:found?.foto||null};let row;if(found){await request(`/rest/v1/estoque?id=eq.${encodeURIComponent(found.id)}`,{token:session.access_token,method:'PATCH',prefer:'return=minimal',body});row={...found,...body}}else if(entry.quantity>0){const rows=await request('/rest/v1/estoque',{token:session.access_token,method:'POST',prefer:'return=representation',body});row=rows[0]}if(row&&nextKeys.has(key)){metadata[row.id]={...previous,brand:clean(entry.item.brand||row.aplicacao),supplier:'Luizinho',cost:Number(entry.item.unitValue)||0,markup:Number(previous.markup)||0};byKey.set(key,row)}}await writeStockMetadataConfig(session,metadataRow,metadata)}
function validateLuizinhoNote(record){const date=supplierDate(record?.date),day=new Date(`${date}T12:00:00`).getDay(),items=normalizeLuizinhoItems(record?.items);if(day<1||day>5)throw new Error('As notas do Luizinho devem ser lançadas de segunda a sexta.');if(!items.length)throw new Error('Inclua pelo menos um item com descrição, quantidade e valor.');return{...record,date,items,description:items.map(item=>item.description).join(', '),amount:Number(items.reduce((sum,item)=>sum+item.total,0).toFixed(2))}}
export async function saveLuizinhoNote(record){if(currentEmail()!==OWNER_EMAIL)throw new Error('Somente o proprietário pode alterar acertos de fornecedores.');const session=await refreshSession();if(!session?.access_token)throw new Error('Sessão expirada');const data=await readSupplierSettlements(),note=validateLuizinhoNote({...record,id:record?.id||crypto.randomUUID()}),movement=await request(`/rest/v1/sincronizacao?entidade=eq.estoque_entrada_luizinho&registro_id=eq.${encodeURIComponent(note.id)}&select=id&limit=1`,{token:session.access_token});if(!movement.length){await applyLuizinhoStockDelta(session,[],note.items);await request('/rest/v1/sincronizacao',{token:session.access_token,method:'POST',prefer:'return=minimal',body:{origem:'app',entidade:'estoque_entrada_luizinho',registro_id:note.id,dados:{itens:note.items,data:note.date}}})}const index=data.luizinho.findIndex(item=>item.id===note.id),saved={...note,stockApplied:true,createdAt:data.luizinho[index]?.createdAt||new Date().toISOString(),updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()};if(index>=0)data.luizinho[index]=saved;else data.luizinho.push(saved);return writeSupplierSettlements(data)}
export async function updateLuizinhoNote(id,changes){if(currentEmail()!==OWNER_EMAIL)throw new Error('Somente o proprietário pode alterar acertos de fornecedores.');const session=await refreshSession();if(!session?.access_token)throw new Error('Sessão expirada');const data=await readSupplierSettlements(),index=data.luizinho.findIndex(item=>item.id===id);if(index<0)throw new Error('Nota do Luizinho não encontrada.');const previous=data.luizinho[index],note=validateLuizinhoNote({...previous,...changes,id});if(previous.stockApplied)await applyLuizinhoStockDelta(session,previous.items,note.items);data.luizinho[index]={...previous,...note,stockApplied:previous.stockApplied,updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()};return writeSupplierSettlements(data)}
export async function deleteLuizinhoNote(id){if(currentEmail()!==OWNER_EMAIL)throw new Error('Somente o proprietário pode alterar acertos de fornecedores.');const session=await refreshSession();if(!session?.access_token)throw new Error('Sessão expirada');const data=await readSupplierSettlements(),note=data.luizinho.find(item=>item.id===id);if(!note)throw new Error('Nota do Luizinho não encontrada.');if(note.stockApplied)await applyLuizinhoStockDelta(session,note.items,[]);data.luizinho=data.luizinho.filter(item=>item.id!==id);return writeSupplierSettlements(data)}
